cases.scenario:
A team has defined the following tokens for their design system:
```
--color-brand: #0A52A1;
--color-brand-hover: #083E7B;
--color-success: #198754;
--color-danger: #DC3545;
--color-surface: #FFFFFF;
--color-surface-subtle: #F8F9FA;
--color-text: #212529;
--color-text-muted: #6C757D;
```

They want to add dark mode support. For dark mode, the brand color needs to lighten (so it is readable on a dark background), surfaces need to darken, and text needs to lighten. The team asks: 'How should we structure the token system to support dark mode without breaking all 85 components?'
